15
00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:47.110
I wanted to talk about what it was like to really grow up

16
00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:51.507
in a single mom, economically challenged way.

17
00:00:52.430 --> 00:00:54.080
And I felt like I didn't have the liberty

18
00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:57.610
because people just assumed that my life was different

19
00:00:57.610 --> 00:00:59.050
