25
00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:13.100 line:15%
and especially in the industry you were in,

26
00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:15.150 line:15%
that you were put into as a child,

27
00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:17.100
you walk into a door and there's assumptions

28
00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:18.850
that are automatically made, in your case,

29
00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:22.036
and you said and, I saw that very early on

