I looked at my mom's side of the family, my dad's side,

64
00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:46.000
and I thought, you know what?

65
00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.670
I'm going with the Mississippi side.

66
00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:50.980
Cause that is, I want that to be my American story more

67
00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:53.703
